Iridium 1.0.44 - Cover Image Support

✨ New feature:
- Added cover image support for bot messages
- Set via: python3 runclientbot.py config COVER_IMAGE <url_or_file_id>
- Supports URL or Telegram file_id
- Leave empty for text-only messages

🔧 Changes:
- Removed deprecated YooKassa settings from config
- Cleaner config file structure
